  "question_stem": "Last Saturday, 200 drivers entering a car park were asked the time, in minutes, that it had taken them to travel from home to the car park. The results are summarised in the following cumulative frequency table.\n\n| Time ($t$ minutes) | $t \\le 10$ | $t \\le 20$ | $t \\le 30$ | $t \\le 50$ | $t \\le 70$ | $t \\le 90$ |\n| Cumulative frequency | 16 | 50 | 106 | 146 | 176 | 200 |",
  "context_texts": [
    "The cumulative-frequency curve passes through $(0,0),(10,16),(20,50),(30,106),(50,146),(70,176),(90,200)$."
  ],
